                              "rawSource":  "//Get Locations and filter\n\n\u0026LocationsListAux = SDPHomeSampleMapLocations()\n\nFor \u0026LocationItem in \u0026LocationsListAux\n\tIf \u0026CityRegion \u003c 2 OR \u0026LocationItem.Id \u003e 3\n\t\t\u0026LocationsList.Add(\u0026LocationItem)\n\tEndIf\nEndFor\n",
